        <dc:description>&lt;p class="description"&gt;The World We Never knew is an anthropomorphic story set in modern day which takes the reader to a different world.  It is a love story, and adventure with a wolf named Dotson and his love Crista.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The World We Never knew is an anthropomorphic story set in modern day which takes the reader to a different world. It is a love story, and adventure with a wolf named Dotson and his love Crista. It is a story about a family, and friends, and the battles they face with each other and against each other.
**&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
